Z||000009||Dave Gunsul||04-30-2001||11:44 PM||||Well i just sent an email to them.<BR>If you go there; click on the about MCC button<BR>on the top of the screen and a window will open on the left that will say "will you ever<BR>feature this car", click on that and you're<BR>in business. At the end of the email there's<BR>a "comments" box that allows you to add more<BR>to your story idea, so don't try to fit it all in the small box at the beginning.<BR>I told them about the Dells and about doing a show about V8 Archie.<BR>Any chance I'll get a free V8 install if they<BR>do a show on you Archie?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
